<title>HUNGARY: CESI plunges as Warsaw, Budapest, Prague end lower.</title>
<headline>CESI plunges as Warsaw, Budapest, Prague end lower.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index plummeted on Friday at 1,409.31 points, down 33.66 points or 2.33 percent, the Budapest Stock Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index declined as all the three markets closed lower.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 50 shares on the Budapest, Prague and Warsaw bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
